<title>USA: Boston University sells $100 mln in 100-yr notes.</title>
<headline>Boston University sells $100 mln in 100-yr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Boston University was priced on Tuesday according to sole manager Lehman Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER BOSTON UNIVERSITY</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.625 PCT  MATURITY 7/15/2097</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.328  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.676 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 95 BPS     CALLABLE NON-CALL 30</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
